The inference-backend-catalog ADR shipped on this branch as ADR-034, which
collides with main's ADR-034 (public-deployment, tiered isolation). It also
could not take 036 — ADR-032's "Future work" list + VISION.md reserve 036 for
the planned argument-quality-metrics ADR. 037 is the next truly-free number.

Renames the file and updates every catalog reference (INDEX, ADR-035, crux_
detector.py, the two catalog test docstrings, PROJECT_STRUCTURE, WORKLOG, two
handovers). Leaves ADR-032's own forward-reference list (034 external-resources,
036 argument-quality) untouched — those are a separate numbering reconciliation.

NOT pushed — staged locally per operator instruction; land when feat is stable.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
